<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala B rises 7.14  pct to 18.75 pesos.</title>
<headline>Ayala B rises 7.14  pct to 18.75 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ayala Corp B jumped by 1.25 pesos, or 7.14 percent, to 18.75 in late Manila trade as foreign investors continued to buy the issue after last week's battering, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;There's a lot of order from foreign brokers. Maybe, they think the issue is undervalued at present levels,&quot; said one trader.</p>
</text>
